00:15:22.620 --> 00:15:25.680
I'm going to visit some friends.

00:15:26.120 --> 00:15:27.120
In that case...

00:15:27.120 --> 00:15:27.320
Fluffy cream

00:15:27.320 --> 00:15:28.580
Fluffy cream
Try this.

00:15:28.820 --> 00:15:31.310
So, you ran into Natsume.

00:15:31.560 --> 00:15:34.150
Natsume Sempai was very friendly.

00:15:34.430 --> 00:15:36.690
I wish she was always like that.

00:15:37.130 --> 00:15:39.160
