00:15:44.570 --> 00:15:46.500
Let's snack on it later.

00:15:46.870 --> 00:15:48.540
What do all of you have to do today?

00:15:48.540 --> 00:15:49.840
I've got free time.

00:15:49.840 --> 00:15:52.080
We've got to do homework.

00:15:52.080 --> 00:15:53.010
Yeah...

00:15:53.480 --> 00:15:55.410
We'll come to the second floor
when we're finished.

00:15:55.410 --> 00:15:56.580
Okay!

00:15:56.580 --> 00:15:58.110
What should we do with the photos?

00:15:58.480 --> 00:16:00.350
Can I keep them?

00:16:00.350 --> 00:16:02.150
Sure, we took them together after all.

00:16:03.820 --> 00:16:05.460
Then, let's play rock-paper-scissors

00:16:05.460 --> 00:16:07.530
to decide who goes first,
then pick them by waiver order.

00:16:07.530 --> 00:16:08.760
What's that?

00:16:13.300 --> 00:16:15.030
She should be able to see that.

00:16:15.030 --> 00:16:16.130
Yeah!

00:16:18.070 --> 00:16:19.440
We're coming in!

00:16:19.440 --> 00:16:21.170
We've been expecting you!

00:16:21.570 --> 00:16:23.040
Are you all done?

00:16:23.340 --> 00:16:24.710
Just about.

00:16:24.710 --> 00:16:26.910
I managed to finish everything.

00:16:27.880 --> 00:16:29.720
What will you have to drink?

00:16:29.720 --> 00:16:32.650
Thanks, I'd like something warm.

00:16:36.820 --> 00:16:38.550
Out of all of these...

00:16:38.960 --> 00:16:42.120
This one is the first you took.

00:16:42.900 --> 00:16:45.230
Is that the one we took from
the front at a low angle?

00:16:45.230 --> 00:16:50.430
I took it because I figured
that you didn't want it.

00:16:50.840 --> 00:16:52.140
I'm going to dispose of this.

00:16:52.140 --> 00:16:55.170
What? But there's writing on this one too.

00:16:55.170 --> 00:16:56.770
It's such a waste.

00:16:57.540 --> 00:17:02.920
Then, can I add a note to make it obvious
that this was a bad picture?

00:17:02.920 --> 00:17:04.880
You don't need to go that far.

00:17:04.880 --> 00:17:08.090
Just one line, that will be enough.

00:17:08.090 --> 00:17:09.560
Is black all right?

00:17:09.560 --> 00:17:11.060
Yeah, thanks.

00:17:11.060 --> 00:17:11.960
Squeak

00:17:11.960 --> 00:17:13.060
Squeak
Squeak
Squeak

