No looking!
Why was it taken from the
front at a low angle?!

00:17:17.630 --> 00:17:18.730
Yunocchi! Yunocchi!

00:17:18.730 --> 00:17:19.700
Yeah!

00:17:23.200 --> 00:17:24.770
Chika thinks it's great!

00:17:24.770 --> 00:17:25.870
Yeah!

00:17:25.870 --> 00:17:27.940
Chika? Were you texting her?

00:17:27.940 --> 00:17:28.980
Yeah!

00:17:28.980 --> 00:17:31.880
I took a picture of this picture with my cell
phone and sent it to her as an attachment.

00:17:31.880 --> 00:17:32.040
I shall guide you to happiness!

00:17:32.040 --> 00:17:33.310
I shall guide you to happiness!
You showed her this?

00:17:33.680 --> 00:17:35.980
