fun at Hidamari Apartments today

00:17:35.980 --> 00:17:38.110
and that she'd like to join in.

00:17:38.520 --> 00:17:41.090
Chika should come here again.

00:17:41.090 --> 00:17:43.080
Can she come during spring break?

00:17:43.390 --> 00:17:44.860
I'm not sure.

00:17:44.860 --> 00:17:46.830
Sae, did you ask her?

00:17:46.830 --> 00:17:47.690
Gulp

00:17:48.530 --> 00:17:50.160
I still haven't.

00:17:50.160 --> 00:17:51.600
What?!

00:17:51.600 --> 00:17:54.530
That's not good.
You have to invite her yourself.

00:17:54.530 --> 00:17:58.330
Well, Chika says that she'd
like to come over.

00:17:58.640 --> 00:18:00.270
Want to call her right now?

00:18:00.270 --> 00:18:01.400
Let's do that!

00:18:07.310 --> 00:18:08.780
Hello, this is Chika.

00:18:08.780 --> 00:18:11.410
This is Yuno. It's been a while!

00:18:11.720 --> 00:18:14.190
Umm, I'm going to pass
the phone over to Sae.

00:18:14.950 --> 00:18:16.150
Huh?

00:18:19.960 --> 00:18:21.030
Hello?

00:18:21.030 --> 00:18:22.690
Hello. What's going on?

00:18:23.260 --> 00:18:26.320
Want to come here over spring break?

00:18:30.140 --> 00:18:31.240
I do!

00:18:31.240 --> 00:18:32.270
Can I?

00:18:32.270 --> 00:18:35.010
Yeah, you worked really hard
on your entrance exams.

00:18:35.010 --> 00:18:38.410
Thank you, sis, Yuno, and everyone else.

00:18:38.680 --> 00:18:40.440
Pass the phone over to me.

00:18:41.510 --> 00:18:43.810
Hello!

00:18:44.120 --> 00:18:46.620
Stay over for a week this time.

00:18:46.620 --> 00:18:48.180
No, not that long.

00:18:48.390 --> 00:18:50.650
I heard Sae.

00:18:51.020 --> 00:18:53.550
She didn't have to be so opposed to it.

00:18:54.660 --> 00:18:55.530
Want to talk to her?

00:18:55.530 --> 00:18:57.290
I'll call her again later.

00:18:57.700 --> 00:18:58.960
Can I talk to her?

00:18:59.470 --> 00:19:00.430
This is Hiro.

00:19:01.000 --> 00:19:02.300
Hello!

00:19:02.300 --> 00:19:04.900
We would love it if you came over.

00:19:04.900 --> 00:19:06.670
Talk to your mom about it.

00:19:06.670 --> 00:19:07.670
Okay!

00:19:07.670 --> 00:19:11.480
Thank you very much.
I'm really looking forward to it.

00:19:11.480 --> 00:19:14.070
Okay! I'm going to pass the
phone over to Yuno.

00:19:15.180 --> 00:19:20.150
Umm, I'm also looking forward to seeing you.

00:19:20.150 --> 00:19:21.620
I hope you can come.

00:19:21.620 --> 00:19:23.420
I think it will be all right.

00:19:23.790 --> 00:19:27.290
But I have to talk to my mom
and Sae about the date.

00:19:27.290 --> 00:19:29.660
Okay! Well, talk to you later.

